-- COMBO_WICK | Kaiju Alpha | Beam Aim (standalone test GUI)
-- HOW THE GAME AIMS BEAMS (PlayerScripts Control funcdump, FireBeam): while your beam is active the client
-- loops every ~0.01s: Remotes.GetMousePos:FireServer(Mouse.Hit.Position), and lerps your kaiju to face that
-- point. The server starts/stops it with CombatRemote "DoBeam", true/false. So the beam goes wherever
-- Mouse.Hit says. We spoof Mouse.Hit (for game scripts only) + the GetMousePos argument to the locked
-- target's position, and can also lock the camera on it (during a beam the game switches you to
-- CameraRelative rotation, so the camera direction turns your kaiju too).
